  "body": "Only try to backfill event if we haven't tried before recently. No need to keep trying the same backfill point that fails over and over. Perhaps an exponential back-off strategy.\r\n\r\nFollow-up to https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/13621\r\n\r\nPart of making `/messages` faster: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/13356\r\n\r\nRelated to:\r\n\r\n - https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/8451\r\n - https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/10764\r\n - https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/11091\r\n - https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/2504\r\n",
